function Legal({type}:{type:'privacy'|'terms'}) { const privacy=type==='privacy'; return <><header><a className="logo" href="/"><BrandMark/>DETAIL</a><a className="nav-cta" href="/">Back home</a></header><main className="legal"><p className="eyebrow">CATALYST LABS</p><h1>{privacy?'Privacy Policy':'Terms of Use'}</h1><p>Last updated: 17 September 2026</p>{privacy?<><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you join our waitlist, we collect whether you are joining as a customer or cleaner, your full name, phone number, email address, country, city, area or suburb, preferred language, service interests, marketing-email choice, campaign attribution and privacy acceptance record. We also retain a one-way network identifier for abuse prevention.</p><h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use this information to operate the beta waitlist, plan service coverage, provide requested service updates, prevent abuse and support you. We send promotional or marketing email only when your recorded marketing choice is Yes. Optional, consent-gated analytics contain interaction events and campaign parameters, never your form contents.</p><h2>Sharing and retention</h2><p>We use vetted infrastructure and email providers to process this information. We do not sell personal information. We retain waitlist records while planning and operating the beta, or until you ask us to delete yours, subject to legal requirements.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can say No to marketing without affecting your waitlist request and can withdraw a prior Yes at any time. To access, correct or delete your details or change your marketing preference, email <a href="mailto:support@detailapp.co.zw">support@detailapp.co.zw</a>.</p></>:<><h2>Beta access</h2><p>Joining the waitlist does not guarantee access, a launch date, cleaner availability or service coverage. We may release access by service and area as operations become ready.</p><h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>Submit accurate information, do not misuse the form or interfere with the service, and do not impersonate another person. </p><h2>Communications and changes</h2><p>Operational messages about your waitlist request are separate from optional marketing. Marketing is sent only when you select Yes, and you may unsubscribe at any time. We may update these terms as the service develops and will identify material changes.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:info@detailapp.co.zw">info@detailapp.co.zw</a>. Support: <a href="mailto:support@detailapp.co.zw">support@detailapp.co.zw</a>.</p></>}</main></> }

